  "description": "Stories are power. Artifacts born from myths and folktales granted humanity abilities and wealth, sparking a brutal war for their ownership. After conquering that war, I became the King of Artifacts, Majesty. But when humanity was forcibly reset and the Majesty War began, I realized my victory was only the beginning. Now, I’ll reclaim everything stolen from me, overturn myths, steal the rules, and plunder worlds by my own law.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
